---

**To deploy (Firebase Console):**

1. Go to **[console.firebase.google.com](https://console.firebase.google.com)** → select project **green-task-orbit**
2. Left sidebar → **Firestore Database** → **Rules** tab
3. Replace everything in the editor with the full rules below
4. Click **Publish**

